---
description: |
  Builds the OCSF actor and AI agent of an event that an agent performed.

  Agentmetry records the agent by the name of its harness, such as `claude`,
  `cursor`, or `codex`, and one session of it under `correlation_id`, which
  becomes the instance UID. The recorder runs the agent's hooks, not a
  framework, so the agent type is Native. The event also gets the OCSF AI
  Operation profile.

  The person the agent acts for is the actor's user. A system actor, such as
  the recorder itself, is not a user and stays in the source event.
args:
  positional:
    - name: agentmetry
      type: field
      description: The Agentmetry event to read.
    - name: ocsf
      type: field
      description: The OCSF event to build.
---

agentmetry::ocsf::actor $agentmetry, $ocsf
$ocsf.ai_agent = {
  name: move $agentmetry.agent.name,
  instance_uid: move $agentmetry.correlation_id?,
  type_id: 1,
}
$ocsf.metadata.profiles = [...$ocsf.metadata.profiles, "ai_operation"]
